     "group": "Off-hook audio protection",
     "name": "overview",
     "prose": {
      "en": "Using off-hook protection features minimises the chance of background conversations being accidentally coupled into handsets, headsets and speakerphones. Limiting the time an active microphone is open minimises this security risk."
